WEBVTT

00:00:03.207 --> 00:00:04.754
Open Tools, Recipes.

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:09.455
The Contact Center recipe for Asterisk turns on the whole set of features

00:00:09.455 --> 00:00:12.787
for that provider in one step, in the right order.

00:00:13.254 --> 00:00:15.619
A recipe turns on features only.

00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:20.536
It carries no queues, skills or entry points, because those refer to your

00:00:20.536 --> 00:00:23.523
provider, your numbers and your campaigns.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.884
That configuration comes from a deployment plan.

